Recommends: fprintd, libpam-fprintd
Description: open-source fingerprint driver for FocalTech 2808:c652 sensors
 libfprint Touch OEM Driver (TOD) plugin for the FocalTech fingerprint sensor
 with USB ID 2808:c652 (Holtek bridge), found in some recent laptops.
 .
 Matching runs on the host (SIFT features + RANSAC) and needs no proprietary
 code. Enrolment takes 40 touches; touches that match confidently are learned
 to improve acceptance over time. Works with fprintd for login, lock screen,
 sudo and polkit prompts.
